<div class="page-head"><div><span class="hand-label">System Configuration</span><h2>Pengaturan Restoran</h2><p>Identitas restoran, pajak, service charge, loyalti, receipt, dan URL QR ordering.</p></div></div><div class="panel"><form id="settingsForm" class="stack"><div class="form-grid"><label>Nama Restoran<input class="control" name="restaurant_name"></label><label>Tagline<input class="control" name="restaurant_tagline"></label><label>Telepon<input class="control" name="restaurant_phone"></label><label>Timezone<input class="control" name="timezone" value="Asia/Makassar"></label><label class="span-2">Alamat<textarea class="control" name="restaurant_address"></textarea></label><label>Tax (%)<input class="control" type="number" step="0.01" min="0" name="tax_rate"></label><label>Service Charge (%)<input class="control" type="number" step="0.01" min="0" name="service_rate"></label><label>Receipt Width<select class="control" name="receipt_width"><option value="58">58 mm</option><option value="80">80 mm</option></select></label><label>Currency<input class="control" name="currency" value="IDR"></label><label>Loyalty<select class="control" name="loyalty_enabled"><option value="1">Aktif</option><option value="0">Nonaktif</option></select></label><label>Belanja per 1 point<input class="control" type="number" min="1" name="loyalty_spend_per_point"></label><label>Durasi Reservasi Default (menit)<input class="control" type="number" min="30" name="reservation_slot_minutes"></label><label>Base URL untuk QR<input class="control" name="base_url" placeholder="https://domain.com"></label><label class="span-2">Footer Struk<textarea class="control" name="receipt_footer"></textarea></label></div><div><button class="btn primary">Simpan Pengaturan</button></div></form></div>
